        "original_id": "54e65612-b899-550b-ab5a-8839180dc90a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Camp Chapman attack\n- People: Humam Khalil Abu-Mulal al-Balawi\n- Organizations: Central Intelligence Agency, United States military, Afghan Army\n- Places: Forward Operating Base Chapman, Camp Chapman\n\nFacts:\n- On December 30, 2009, the Camp Chapman attack was a suicide attack by Humam Khalil Abu-Mulal al-Balawi.\n- The Camp Chapman attack targeted a Central Intelligence Agency facility inside Forward Operating Base Chapman.\n- Forward Operating Base Chapman is also known as Camp Chapman.\n- Forward Operating Base Chapman is a United States military base.\n- Forward Operating Base Chapman is located at the site of a former Afghan Army installation.\n- Forward Operating Base Chapman is also used by the Central Intelligence Agency.",
